        "body_html": "<div class='ytb-lines' style='margin-bottom:14px'><div class='ytb-line mute' data-cue=\"022\">先談股票部位的選股邏輯 —— 三個維度依序篩選。</div></div><div class='cards-3'><div class='card' data-cue=\"023\"><div class='card-num c1'>T</div><div><div class='card-title'>Trend ‧ 趨勢</div><div class='card-body' data-cue=\"024\">只選有結構性需求支撐的大題材；現階段聚焦 AI 與創新科技</div></div></div><div class='card' data-cue=\"025\"><div class='card-num c2'>O</div><div><div class='card-title'>Operation ‧ 營運</div><div class='card-body' data-cue=\"026\">看財報三率 —— 毛利率、營業利益率、淨利率是否穩定成長</div></div></div><div class='card' data-cue=\"027\"><div class='card-num c3'>P</div><div><div class='card-title'>Price ‧ 價格</div><div class='card-body' data-cue=\"028\">遵守評價紀律，等評價合理才布局</div></div></div></div><div class='ytb-note calm' data-cue=\"029\">因為打破市值框架，<b>大型、中型、小型股都在選股池裡</b>。</div>"
